IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble applied to every claim below:
--   "Assuming all other conditions are met and no other exclusions apply
--   (where by 'other' I mean anything not referenced in the query that
--   follows)". Also, per the paper's own prompts: the agreement has been
--   signed and the premium has been paid on time.
--
-- So, on every Claim below:
--   `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
--   `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0        (paid at signing)
--   `dispute arisen`                    IS FALSE          (no query mentions one)
--   `unable to settle month`            IS NOTHING
--   `arbitration commenced month`       IS NOTHING
--   `valid arbitration award issued`    IS TRUE           (moot: no dispute)
--   `written proof of claim month`     IS NOTHING
--   `recovery sought month`             IS NOTHING
--   `policy term months`                IS 12             (Section 3.6: one year)
-- and every other field unrelated to the specific question is set so that
-- coverage holds and no exclusion triggers (see NOTES.md for the one
-- genuinely ambiguous case, Q4's hospitalization month).

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a firefighter.
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
  `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
  `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0
  `hospitalization month`             IS 1
  `hospitalization ground`            IS `Accidental injury`
  `age at hospitalization`            IS 30
  `causes`                            IS LIST Firefighting
  `fraud month`                       IS NOTHING
  `misrepresentation month`           IS NOTHING
  `wellness visit month`              IS JUST 1
  `wellness visit provider qualified` IS TRUE
  `written confirmation month`        IS JUST 1
  `dispute arisen`                    IS FALSE
  `unable to settle month`            IS NOTHING
  `arbitration commenced month`       IS NOTHING
  `valid arbitration award issued`    IS TRUE
  `written proof of claim month`      IS NOTHING
  `recovery sought month`             IS NOTHING
  `policy term months`                IS 12

